AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000131> "Previously had the axiom

'material entity'
 and ('composed primarily of' some 
    ('water ice' or snow))

which ended up making incorrect inference. We chose to obsolete this now.")
