AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000131> "envoPolar")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000131> "Ambiguities in notion of feature and overly general equivalence axiom was making incorrect assertions. For example popsicle would reason under this class.")
