AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4808-4736") rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000133> "The definition of glacier is highly variable. Two main issues exist: 1) Whether or not a mass of ice must currently show movement to be considered a glacier or not and 2) What is the relationship between ice sheets and glaciers (i.e., which is the parent in a parent/child relationship or whether they are distinct terms).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000133> "glacier")
