AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000181> "\"peak\" in the definition is understood as a synonym of mount, rather than of summit. Nunataks may also refer to areas of ridges. The definition and placement of this class may need to be revised.")
