AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000429> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4808-4736>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000429> "2021-04-14T18:57:18.275Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
