AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00002011> "The lower bound of solute concentration required for water to be considered freshwater is variable, but is always less than that of seawater, and often cited as less than 1 gram of solutes per 1 litre of water.")
