# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000033> (oceanic pelagic zone biome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:978-0-444-82619-0") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:978-0-7506-3384-0") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ORCID:0000-0002-4366-3088") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000033> "The oceanic epipelagic zone biome comprises the marine water column offshore, beyond a continental shelf.")
