AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000127> "The marine cold seep biome comprises regions of the marine benthic biome where seepage of methane, hydrogen sulphide, hydrocarbon rich fluids and other fluids occurs.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000127> "marine cold seep biome")
