# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000351> (obsolete marine mesoscale eddy)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.gfdl.noaa.gov/ocean-mesoscale-eddies") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000351> "A marine mesoscale eddy is a current of marine water which has a typical horizontal diameter of less than 100 km and persists for approximately one month.")
