AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dacite>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000444> "Lava which is high in silica and low in alkali metal oxides."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000444> "Rapid solidification of this lava forms dacite."@en)
