AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000595> "cupboard"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000595> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000594>)

