# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000600> (rainwater)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rain") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000600> "Rainwater is liquid water which has precipitated in the form of droplets through the condensation of atmospheric water vapour.")
