AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000630> "Acidification of an aquatic environment is a process whereby the pH of an aquatic environment, biome, or water body is lowered.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000630> "acidification of an aquatic environment"@en)
