AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumice") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000663> "Pumice is a volcanic rock that consists of highly vesicular rough textured volcanic glass, which may or may not contain crystals.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000663> "Scoria differs from pumice in having larger vesicles, thicker vesicle walls and being dark colored and denser.")
