AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000670> "A vein is a geological fracture which is filled with minerals precipitated out of an aqueous solution.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000670> "vein"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000670> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000667>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000670> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0001015> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000256>))

