# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000722> (meltwater)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meltwater") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000722> "Meltwater is the water released by the melting of snow or ice, including glacial ice, tabular icebergs and ice shelves over oceans.")
