# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000754> (fumarole-derived ice tower)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000754> "A hollow tower of ice formed by the freezing of steam escaping a fumarole.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000754> "ice chimney")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000754> "ice tower")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000754> "envoPolar")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000754> "fumarole-derived ice tower"@en)
