# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000863> (overflow structure)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/overfall") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000863> "A structure which is built into the container of a water body which allows water to flow out of the container when the volume of the water contained exceeds that of its cavity.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000863> "overfall")
