# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000864> (mouth of liquid discharge conduit)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.collinsdictionary.com/dictionary/english/overfall") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000864> "A site at the terminus of a liquid conveyance conduit where the liquid carried is discharged into the sea or a river.")
