AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000968> "Sources of water include rivers, lakes, reservoirs, and other water bodies. Conduits include canals, pipelines, and tunnels. Water intakes typically transport water for purposes of hydroelectric power engineering, water supply, or irrigation.")
