AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000983> "The gravitational sphere of influence referenced in this class' definition is the Hill sphere: a region in which an object dominates the attraction of satellites despite gravitational perturbations.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000983> "technosphere"@en)
