AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Groundwater") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001004> "Underground water which is located in pore spaces found in rock or unconsolidated deposits such as soil, clay, or gravel.")
