# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001343> (semi-diurnal marine tidal flow process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001343> "A marine tidal flow process which occurs twice per day, resulting in two high and two low tides per day, both of roughly equal amplitude.")
