AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001452> "A habitat which supports the persistence and growth of a population of Calyptra moths and which overlaps mesic meadows and edges and clearings in vegetated areas.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001452> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
