AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001497> "To measure the state and dynamics of the ocean's carbonate system, at least two of the following qualities must be measured: Dissolved Inorganic Carbon (DIC), Total Alkalinity (TA), Partial pressure of carbon dioxide (pCO2), and pH.")
