# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001615> (material cooling process)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/warming") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001615> "A process during which the temperature of a portion of environmental material is decreased, along with the kinetic energy of its constituent molecules.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001615> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
