# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001633> (agricultural pollution)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "INTERNAS:WS2") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.awi.de/internas") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001633> "An environmental pollution process during which contaminants derived from agricultural activity are released into an environmental system.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001633> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
