AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001635> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001635> "2019-05-29T08:25:13Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
