AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4808-4736>) rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001655> "Note that ice sheets and glaciers are confounded and confused in multiple communities and across multiple sources.")
