# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001668> (atmospheric frontal zone)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Front>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001668> "Part of an atmosphere which contains a weather front, bounded by frontal surfaces."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001668> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
