AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001685> "The thin liquid layer case applies to, e.g., soap bubbles in air. The physical or compositional discontinuity case applies to, e.g., bubbles of CO2 in air or bubbles of air in water."@en)
