AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Dry-adiabatic_process>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001724> "An adiabatic process during which no condensation of water vapor occurs and no liquid water is present.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001724> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
