# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001859> (dew point)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dew_point>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001859> "A temperature of air at which air become saturated with water vapour and below which airborne water vapour will condense to form liquid water (dew).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001859> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001859> "2020-05-18T22:22:04Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
