# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001884> (surface landform)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001884> "A landform which occurs on the surface of an astronomical body."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001884> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001884> "2021-05-15T09:16:23Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001884> "geographic feature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001884> "The usage of \"surface\" here aligns with that of planetary surface: in contact with the atmosphere or space. The extent of the \"surface\" can vary. For rocky planets like Earth, astrogeologists consider the crust as the surface.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001884> "surface landform"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001884> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001886>)

