# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_02000043> (biological product)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "URL:http://www3.niaid.nih.gov/research/resources/DAIDSClinRsrch/Glossary/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_02000043> "A biological product is an environmental substrate comprised of any virus, therapeutic serum, toxin, antitoxin, or analogous product available to prevent, treat or cure diseases or injuries in man.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> "ORCID:0000-0002-4366-3088") rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_02000043> "This definition should be revised, it is currently too ambiguous.")
