# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000012> (glacial transport process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000012> "A material transport process during which the snow and ice constituting a glacier, and anything contained within it, is transported down a slope by gravitation.")
