AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000033> "Particles of marine sediment are primarily generated by 1) processes in terrestrial systems and transported to the marine realm by the action of rivers or aeolian processes (amongst other routes) , 2) marine organisms, 3) chemical processes in seawater, or 4) cosmogeneous input.")
