AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000083> "On Earth, the bright blue appearance, in the light spectrum visible to humans, is due to increased abundances of microorganisms attracted to sulfur compounds associated with the methane release.")
