AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000088> "It would probably be better to assert parthood between the permafrost and cavities filled with gas rather than the gases themselves.")
