AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000088> "Other hydrocarbon gasses such as carbon dioxide may also be present. These pockets can be sufficently large that the permafrost surface will undulate when pressure is applied.")
