AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000116> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000116> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0632-7576>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000116> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4808-4736>)
