AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4808-4736>) rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000141> "Follows from the GCW's snow cover definition 2: In general, a layer of snow on the ground surface. Compare snowfield, snowpack.

Given the SWEET terms location in its heirarchy I think only the 3rd definition is meant."@en)
