# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400008> (lambing storm)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Lambing_storm>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400008> "A snowfall which occurs during springtime and is of low intensity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400008> "Link this to spring once seasons are added to ENVO"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400008> "Strictly, there is no increased rate of snowfall here, but of lamb death. We're not likely to add \"lamb-death storm\" to ENVO. Maybe AGRO would.")
