AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400008> "envoPolar")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Lambing_storm>) rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400008> "This term is primarily used in England and refers to snowfall in lambing season. It is referred to as a \"storm\" as it may adversly affect or kill newborn lambs."@en)
