AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400010> "Could make a freezing rain process class to mirror this in the process hierarchy as subclass to hydrological precipitation process.")
