# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400011> (hail)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4808-4736>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400011> "Precipitation which is composed primarily of hail stones."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03400011> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0337-8610>)
