AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soil_horizon>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://pikeconservation.org/soil-profile/#:~:text=The%20uppermost%20horizon%20is%20called,nutrients%20that%20enrich%20the%20soils>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600011> "A soil horizon which is primarily composed of mineral material."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600011> "ADDED 'composed primarily of' RO:0002473 mineral material 'ENVO:01000256'"@en)
