AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600011> "Usually less than 20% organic carbon. The term mineral horizon refers to surface soil/topsoil and subsoil layer of the soil. When user does not/could not refer to the topsoil or subsoil specifically, the broader term, mineral horizon can be used."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600011> "mineral horizon"@en)
