AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://blog.froztec.com/en/what-is-a-cold-room-and-why-do-you-need-it-for-your-products>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://www.appropedia.org/Cold_room>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600035> "A room which is maintained at lower than ambient temperatures."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600035> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
