AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Industrial_park>) rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600080> "Industrial parks are usually located on the edges of, or outside, the main residential area of a city and that can be thought of as a more \"heavyweight\" version of a business park or office park, which has offices and light industry, rather than heavy industry."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600080> "industrial park"@en)
