AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Water_filter>) rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600086> "Fine physical barrier, a chemical process, or a biological process are applied in the water filter. Filters cleanse water to different extents for purposes such as providing agricultural irrigation, accessible drinking water, public and private aquariums, and the safe use of ponds and swimming pools."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600086> "water filter"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03600086> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00003074>)

