AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fouling>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://www.corrosionpedia.com/definition/540/fouling>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105022> "A material accumulation process during which material builds up on a solid surface such that a function of that surface, or the object it is a part of, is impaired."@en)
