# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105107> (marine anthropogenic litter)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://www.gesamp.org/publications/guidelines-for-the-monitoring-and-assessment-of-plastic-litter-in-the-ocean>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105107> "Anthropogenic litter which is present in the marine environment."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105107> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2996-719X>)
