AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weathering>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://www.britannica.com/science/weathering-geology>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105119> "A material transformation process during which the properties of a material are changed as a result of in situ exposure to atmospheric processes."@en)
