AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://sis.agr.gc.ca/cansis/glossary/t/index.html") rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105275> "Some authorities consider silt loam to be a soil composed of 20-50% of sand, 74-88% silt and 0-27% of clay."@en)
