AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105277> "Loam which has a high proportion of clay in its composition."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105277> "Interestingly, some instances of this class may not actually conform to the definition of loam, by having roughly unequal proportions of sand and silt and quite a large proportion of clay."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105277> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
