AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105280> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105280> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6284-4821>)
