AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105304> "soil water-holding capacity"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105304> "water-holding capacity of soil"@en)
